                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e8d587e-8580-3b12-94b9-d42b0b274d51",
                        "entry_id": "a88cda50-a8b0-3617-b92b-9cccdd44bb9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A defensive encampment encircled by wagons, especially by South African Boers."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7c4dbcf-f7aa-46f9-9b83-0b0e64ec632f",
                                "sense_id": "4e8d587e-8580-3b12-94b9-d42b0b274d51",
                                "text": "Wagons […] can be readily formed into a laager, a camp, by being drawn into a circle, with the oxen placed inside and so kept safe from the attacks of wild beasts."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3f11181a-e677-41de-b89c-00a63a722de3",
                                "sense_id": "4e8d587e-8580-3b12-94b9-d42b0b274d51",
                                "text": "“And for how long d'you think you're going to be safe in the cities?” Louis persisted. “Just a matter of time, then our frontiers will shrink as we draw our little laager more and more tightly.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "72224b0a-db9a-39c7-be15-965a513a8749",
                        "entry_id": "a88cda50-a8b0-3617-b92b-9cccdd44bb9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A temporary formation of armoured vehicles for resupply."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
